# tree-learned path (the fix that makes the e7-RLE / e8-Greedy / e9-Optimal
# schedule real — it was silently dropped before) move bytes on natural
# content?
#
# baseline binary: origin/main 2e6a5caf (pre-fix), release, --locked lock of the day
# postfix  binary: workspace jxl-encoder--lz77ps (fix commit, parent 2e6a5caf)
# host: 7950X WSL2, encodes nice -n19, --threads 8 (bytes are thread-invariant)
# corpus: benchmarks/lossless_bench_set_2026-06-10.tsv (43 k-means picks,
